  ('How long to fix?', 'On standard care the target is the end of the second working day, excluding weekends and bank holidays.'),
  ('Compensation due?', 'Often automatic &mdash; around &pound;9&ndash;&pound;10 a day once a total loss passes two full working days, if your provider is in Ofcom&rsquo;s scheme.'),
