  ('DIY first step', 'Quit OneDrive, remove the &ldquo;OneDrive Cached Credential&rdquo; entries in Credential Manager, restart and sign in once.'),
  ('Will I lose my files?', 'No &mdash; unlinking or resetting only breaks the sync link; just don&rsquo;t delete the local OneDrive folder.'),
