  ('The Hub Manager trick', 'Sign in at 192.168.1.254, temporarily switch off the 5GHz band while the printer joins, then switch it back on afterwards.'),
  ('Can it be fixed remotely?', 'Yes &mdash; we sort the Hub and printer together while you watch, on a no fix, no fee basis.'),
  ('How long does it take?', 'Most problems on this page are fixed in one short remote session, usually the same day.'),
